untrapping success rate for chests and large boxes
[I thought it was 0.5 for an early game character,
but according to folks here who've consulted the
source, it's 0.3] for chests, I ran the numbers to
see just how hard I had to try to #untrap to get the
chance of failure to find a trap below 1/1000 given
as a precondition that the chest was in fact trapped.

